{
  "esm": "0.8.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "duo_upwind",
    "description": "Chen (2021) Eqs 14-15 upwind donor selection at a cell interface: duo_upwind(ustar, qE, qW) = ifelse(ustar > 0, qE, qW). The LMARS normal velocity u* (duo_lmars_ustar) sets the flow direction; the transported quantity is taken from the UPWIND cell -- the left cell's EAST reconstruction qE when u* > 0, else the right cell's WEST reconstruction qW. Used for the materially transported variables (depth h, the parallel velocity component, surface geopotential Phi_s); the pressure forcing Pi is NOT upwinded (it goes through the LMARS average+viscous solve instead). The u*=0 tie resolves to qW; it is a measure-zero case and both branches agree in the smooth limit. AXIS- AND DIRECTION-NEUTRAL: a y-interface binds the North/South states and v* verbatim.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_volume",
      "grid:duo",
      "op:upwind",
      "order:1",
      "scheme:lmars"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Chen, X. (2021). The LMARS based shallow-water dynamical core on generic gnomonic cubed sphere geometry. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 13(1), e2020MS002280.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2020MS002280"
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_templates": {
    "duo_upwind": {
      "params": [
        "ustar",
        "qE",
        "qW"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "ifelse",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": ">",
            "args": [
              "ustar",
              0
            ]
          },
          "qE",
          "qW"
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
